: A pre-output server-side fallback (`fallbacks: "default"`): the requested
: claude-opus-5-5 declined before any output, so message_start names the
: fallback model that served the reply, a `fallback` block (from and to
: each naming a model) comes first in content as an ordinary
: content_block_start, and usage.iterations ends in a fallback_message
: entry. Shapes from the claude-api skill's shared/model-migration.md
: (`refusal` stop reason, Reading the response and Streaming; fallbacks
: "default" under Migrating to Claude Opus 5); usage.iterations' per-entry
: counts are this fixture's, the guide naming only each entry's type.

